INSERT INTO "messages" ("meta","seq","role","session_id","tool_calls","reasoning","inserted_at","id") VALUES ($1,$2,$3,$4,$5,$6,$7,$8) [%{}, 37, :assistant, "4e0d427e-222d-494e-94c1-e4bae425157b", [%{"arguments" => %{"path" => "benchapp/lib/benchapp_web.ex"}, "id" => "chatcmpl-tool-b344b31080970dca", "name" => "read"}, %{"arguments" => %{"path" => "benchapp/lib/benchapp_web/router.ex"}, "id" => "chatcmpl-tool-8507582c17022099", "name" => "read"}, %{"arguments" => %{"path" => "benchapp/lib/benchapp_web/live/home_live.ex"}, "id" => "chatcmpl-tool-9deb7c5fcb9304b4", "name" => "read"}], "Checked the instructions in AGENTS.md. Key points:\n- Use `<Layouts.app flash={@flash}>` wrapper\n- For UI primitives, use JobyKit.CoreComponents wrappers (`.button`, `.input`, `.icon`, `.card`, etc.)\n- Register components in DesignManifest and run `mix joby_kit.lint`\n- Wrapper contract: attr declarations, data-component, attr :rest, :global, manifest entry\n- Don't write raw `<button>`, `<input>`, etc. outside of wrapper definitions\n- When done, run `mix precommit`\n- Test guidelines: use element/2, has_element/2, etc.\n\nContinuing exploration. Need to read the following:\n- lib/benchapp_web.ex (imports/aliases)\n- lib/benchapp_web/router.ex\n- lib/benchapp_web/live/home_live.ex\n- lib/benchapp_web/design_manifest.ex (generated version)\n- lib/benchapp_web/design_previews.ex (generated version)\n- lib/benchapp_web/components/composite_components.ex (generated version)\n- JobyKit.NavComponent source (simple_nav) — for building my own nav\n- JobyKit.CoreComponents — theme_toggle and other components\n- config files (port settings)\n- test/support/conn_case.ex\n- AGENTS.md mentions curling design.json — good idea after startup\n\nGoing to read several files together.\n", ~U[2026-09-11 07:50:29.411023Z], "2ecb49ca-c288-44c4-9a32-a094498123ce"]
