[:test]\nIncluding tags: [location: {\"test/benchapp_web/live/about_live_test.exs\", 18}]\n\n\n\n  1) test navigates from home to about via the nav (BenchappWeb.AboutLiveTest)\n     test/benchapp_web/live/about_live_test.exs:17\n     ** (ArgumentError) expected selector \"#main-nav a[href=\\\"/about\\\"]\" to return a single element, but got 2: \n\n     <a phx-r=\"\" href=\"/about\" data-phx-link=\"redirect\" data-phx-link-state=\"push\" class=\"rounded-field\">\n             About\n           </a><a phx-r=\"\" href=\"/about\" data-phx-link=\"redirect\" data-phx-link-state=\"push\" class=\"rounded-field\">\n               About\n             </a>\n     code: |> render_click()\n     stacktrace:\n       (phoenix_live_view 1.2.11) lib/phoenix_live_view/test/live_view_test.ex:1229: Phoenix.LiveViewTest.call/2\n       test/benchapp_web/live/about_live_test.exs:22: (test)\n\n", "chatcmpl-tool-a3618afdc1c2e4d6", ~U[2026-09-11 08:09:43.214098Z], "790ccc0c-3c86-4fcb-aaef-376fe7c85c18"]
