INSERT INTO "messages" ("meta","seq","role","session_id","tool_calls","reasoning","inserted_at","id") VALUES ($1,$2,$3,$4,$5,$6,$7,$8) [%{}, 150, :assistant, "4e0d427e-222d-494e-94c1-e4bae425157b", [%{"arguments" => %{"new_string" => "  test \"navigates from home to about via the nav\", %{conn: conn} do\n    {:ok, view, _html} = live(conn, ~p\"/\")\n\n    assert {:error, {:live_redirect, %{to: \"/about\"}}} =\n             view\n             |> element(~S{#main-nav ul.menu-horizontal a[href=\"/about\"]})\n             |> render_click()\n\n    {:ok, view, _html} = live(conn, ~p\"/about\")\n    assert render(view) =~ \"Meet Lumen\"\n  end", "old_string" => "  test \"navigates from home to about via the nav\", %{conn: conn} do\n    {:ok, view, _html} = live(conn, ~p\"/\")\n\n    html =\n      view\n      |> element(~S{#main-nav ul.menu-horizontal a[href=\"/about\"]})\n      |> render_click()\n\n    assert html =~ \"Meet Lumen\"\n  end", "path" => "benchapp/test/benchapp_web/live/about_live_test.exs"}, "id" => "chatcmpl-tool-a4f18a439442cc0e", "name" => "edit"}], "`follow_redirect/2` is referenced in the docs, but what's defined in 1.2.11 is only `__follow_redirect__` — follow_redirect/2 might be generated... no wait, follow_redirect/2 was deprecated and removed in 1.0. The docs are outdated. Therefore the correct test pattern is as follows:\n\n```elixir\nassert {:error, {:live_redirect, %{to: \"/about\"}}} = render_click(link)\n{:ok, view, html} = live(conn, \"/about\")  # re-enter the connection? The connection isn't updated\n```\n\nThe pattern recommended in LV 1.x's \"Testing redirects\":\n```elixir\nassert {:error, {:live_redirect, %{to: \"/about\"}}} = ...render_click()\n```\nAnd to continue the test, call `live(conn, \"/about\")` fresh. This will verify navigation was requested — sufficient for our purposes. Furthermore, to verify that the new page's nav marks about as current, run a second live() and... the first test already covers the about page's aria-current. Simplification: assert on the redirect tuple.\n", ~U[2026-09-11 08:13:53.961496Z], "9ec0783d-3a0c-40e5-b237-e8f75e788b45"]
